Oga Tatsumi (1º)

213
00:17:25,480 --> 00:17:33,190
Kunieda Aoi (2º)

214
00:17:25,480 --> 00:17:33,190
Toujou Hidetora (3º)

215
00:17:25,770 --> 00:17:34,230
Kanzaki Hajime (3º)

216
00:17:27,190 --> 00:17:35,400
Himekawa Tatsuya (3º)

217
00:17:28,520 --> 00:17:35,400
Natsume Shintaro (3º)

218
00:17:29,980 --> 00:17:35,490
Furuichi Takayuki (1º)

219
00:17:26,260 --> 00:17:27,210
Oga Tatsumi.

220
00:17:27,630 --> 00:17:28,570
Kunieda Aoi.

221
00:17:29,130 --> 00:17:30,190
Toujou Hidetora.

222
00:17:30,470 --> 00:17:31,360
Kanzaki Hajime.

223
00:17:31,810 --> 00:17:32,700
Himekawa Tatsuya.

224
00:17:33,170 --> 00:17:34,450
Natsume Shintaro...

225
00:17:35,820 --> 00:17:37,550
Furuichi Takayuki...

226
